      "widgets_values_named": {
        "prompt": "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the broad-shouldered adult man in black period clothing, with tied dark hair and short stubble, shown in <Picture 1>–<Picture 4>.\n<Subject 2> is Chu Yanyu, the young woman in the pale rose period dress, with long dark hair arranged with a small jade hairpin, shown in <Picture 1>–<Picture 4>.\n<Subject 3> is Qing'er, the shorter companion in a grey-green period outfit, with a round face and dark hair tied with green ribbons, shown in <Picture 1>–<Picture 4>.\n<Subject 4> is the sunlit mountain path, rocky cliff, bushes and distant ridges shared by all four reference images.\n<Picture 1>, <Picture 2>, <Picture 3>, and <Picture 4> anchor [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], and [Shot 4] respectively, in reading order.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] Create an exact 15-second, 16:9 3D CG period-drama video following the four sequential reference compositions. Chu Yanyu privately thinks about delaying their escort, offers him more money aloud, hears his refusal, then quietly tells Qing’er to stay close. Preserve the independent walking and the distance between characters.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (all shots): fully_preserved — preserve his reference identity, black clothing and position following the companions.\n<Subject 2> (all shots): fully_preserved — preserve her reference identity, rose clothing, hair and restrained expressions.\n<Subject 3> (all shots): fully_preserved — preserve her distinct reference identity, shorter stature, grey-green clothing and position beside Chu Yanyu.\n<Subject 4> (all shots): fully_preserved — retain the path, cliff, vegetation, light direction and uphill travel.\n<Picture 1> ([Shot 1]): fully_preserved — retain its composition and opening action.\n<Picture 2> ([Shot 2]): fully_preserved — retain its speaker framing and gesture.\n<Picture 3> ([Shot 3]): fully_preserved — retain its speaker framing and listener positions.\n<Picture 4> ([Shot 4]): fully_preserved — retain its closing composition and reactions.\n\ndetailed_description:\nUse the reference images' 3D CG animation style, stylized character rendering, natural daylight and period clothing throughout. Everyone walks under their own power, with feet naturally contacting the ground and no grabbing or carrying. Dialogue is the exact Mandarin text in the following blocks, spoken once in order with natural brisk delivery. There are no additional spoken words, indistinct conversations, narrator or system voice. No subtitles or speech bubbles. Speaker identities remain stable across all shots.\n[Shot 1] From 00:00.000 to 00:03.000, use <Picture 1>'s framing of <Subject 2> scanning the deserted mountain path while walking beside <Subject 3>. <Subject 1> follows at a distance. <Subject 2> (S2), with a clear young female Mandarin voice, says in an off-screen voiceover: <d>[Chinese] 山里没人，得想办法拖住他。</d> while her lips remain completely closed. This is her private thought, heard only by the audience; the other characters neither hear nor answer it.\n[Shot 2] At 00:03.000, cut to <Picture 2>'s composition. <Subject 2> turns her head toward <Subject 1> without stopping her steps. Now she speaks aloud in her same voice (S2), briskly but distinctly: <d>[Chinese] 宋家给你多少？放了我们，我给双倍。</d> Her lips articulate only this aloud line. <Subject 1> listens, walking behind her with space between them. End the line by 00:07.000.\n[Shot 3] At 00:07.000, cut to <Picture 3>'s medium shot of <Subject 1>. He shakes his head once and says in a low, slightly rough adult male Mandarin voice (S1), firmly and at a brisk clear pace: <d>[Chinese] 收了定金，就得按约办事。到山上等消息，别耍花样。</d> <Subject 2> listens without interrupting. No physical contact occurs; everyone continues walking. Finish by 00:13.000.\n[Shot 4] At 00:13.000, cut to <Picture 4>'s framing of the two companions. <Subject 2> turns back toward <Subject 3> and says softly aloud in her established voice (S2): <d>[Chinese] 跟紧我。</d> <Subject 3> gives a small nod without speaking. They walk side by side; the path continues uphill and <Subject 1> follows behind. End at 00:15.000.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nContinuous light mountain wind, quiet distant birds, footsteps on gravel and soft fabric movement. Keep ambience below the scripted voices. No crowd speech or additional vocalizations.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A",
